  message: "Merged via PR #3129 (commit b0caac324) on 2026-04-17 by human review per governance flow. Stop hook now polls for watched processes (pytest / python -m pytest / smart-test / bash ./scripts/auto-pr / bash ./scripts/merge-pr) and waits inline with dot-stream heartbeat instead of the prior 150s blanket sleep. Returns immediately when nothing watched is alive. Hash-write semantics unchanged. Bakeoffs and ci-debug deliberately excluded from watched list to preserve pipeline-overlap workflow."  # 1d85
